## CRITICAL WARNINGS

1. **54% of indie products make $0 revenue** [K] [SOURCE: Scraping Fish analysis]. Only 5% exceed $100K/year [K]. These models are real but the BASE RATE for solo operators is harsh.

2. **All income projections above are [T]-tagged.** Real practitioner income data is sparse for most models. The verified cases (Scrapelabs, SaaSHub, Real Work From Anywhere, Stratechery) are SURVIVORS — you're seeing the winners, not the 95% who tried and failed.

3. **"Brain leverage" does not mean "no work."** Every model above requires 6-18 months of intense effort before cash flow materializes. The LEVERAGE kicks in after the position is established — not before.

4. **AI disruption is real and accelerating.** Models #8 (dev brokering), #12 (sourcing agent), and any pure-translation position are on a 2-3 year countdown. Models requiring human judgment (compliance, deal sourcing, quality arbitrage, curation) are more durable.

5. **Absence of failure evidence ≠ safety.** For models where no failed practitioners were found (VN data APIs, byproduct brokering, auction intelligence), this means the data is thin — not that the models are safe.

